## Final recommendation

Build the website around a focused engineering partner that solves business problems, with websites as an accessible entry service and integrations, custom systems, and automation as deeper engineering offerings.

The most important design principle is to combine international-grade engineering credibility with the realities of Ugandan buyers and devices: clear pricing expectations, direct contact, mobile-first usability, lightweight delivery, relevant integrations, honest evidence, and reliable post-launch support.

The next implementation step should be a repository-backed website audit that maps the existing pages, components, design tokens, performance, accessibility, and content against this research and the preserved design-system audit. That audit should produce a precise keep/change/build mapping before the visual redesign begins.
